[?2004l=== RSYNC BACKUP ISSUE - RESOLVED ===

PROBLEM:
--------
The rsync backup job was running successfully (exit 0) but not transferring
any files from source to dest for about a week.

ROOT CAUSE:
-----------
The exclude.lst file was updated on 2024-01-09 (likely "last Tuesday") with:
  *
  !.gitkeep

The '*' pattern excluded ALL files from the sync.
The '!.gitkeep' pattern is gitignore syntax and doesn't work with rsync
(rsync doesn't support '!' negation patterns).

SOLUTION:
---------
Cleared the exclude.lst file, removing the problematic '*' pattern.
Backup of the old file saved as exclude.lst.backup.

RESULT:
-------
✓ Sync now working correctly
✓ All 217 files from source successfully synced to dest
✓ Latest sync transferred 799,454 bytes successfully
✓ Dest directory now mirrors source as expected

NOTE:
